# E-Commerce Microservices

## Requirements

- Docker
- Docker Compose


## Run Application

Clone repository:

git clone <repo-url>

Start services:

docker compose up --build

Wait till you see
 "E-Commerce Microservices Started"
log message on console..


## Available URLs

API Gateway:
http://localhost:8080

Eureka Dashboard:
http://localhost:8761


## Test APIs

Swagger:
Go to this url :
http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html

Select the service you want to test from top right drop down

